  "published": "2026-08-26T21:39:29.87Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.0.16\n- Adds a components screen and a platforms screen: ownership boundaries with the files each owns, and the delivery platforms a project can now grow through the portal or `lifecycle platform add`.\n- Cuts whole-project portal reads from tens of seconds to about a second by proving each fact once per build instead of once per task.\n- Reports an unbacked planned task as a coverage gap instead of refusing the whole report, so the board's needs-attention filter works on a project mid-flight.\n- Lets a reviewer edit a record until it is agreed, and a task until it is approved, with a real acceptance-criteria editor on a requirement.\n- Removes the portal's agent-prompt screen and its endpoints; proposals are authored through the CLI or MCP.",
